Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root and follow it. It is the canonical instruction file for every agent here.
The UI lane's full brief is `docs/lanes/ui.md`; read it before any work. Guardrail hooks are wired in
`.cursor/hooks.json` (the same scripts Claude Code runs; trust the workspace so they load). Honor their rules
even if hooks are not firing: never edit secrets or lock files.
